<title>USA: Datascope says FDA clears vascular device.</title>
<headline>Datascope says FDA clears vascular device.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVALE, N.J. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datascope Corp on Tuesday said it received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its VasoSeal device for sealing vascular punctures after interventional radiology procedures.</p>
<p>The company expects that the emerging interventionist market will help it meet its goal of extending the growth of its VasoSeal sales, even though that market's potential has yet to be determined.</p>
</text>
